          ]
        }
      ],
      "core_meaning_cn": "不受限制、保留或相对条件约束的“完全/绝对”；权力语境可指不受制度约束",
      "core_meaning_en": "complete or unlimited by qualification; of power, unrestricted by external control",
      "mental_model_cn": "按语境区分：absolute certainty 是完全确定；an absolute requirement 是无保留、无例外的要求；absolute power 是不受限制的权力；absolute amount 是不相对于基准的量，不必达到最大值。",
      "mental_model_en": "Use context: complete certainty; a requirement allowing no exceptions; unrestricted power; or an amount measured without a relative reference, which need not be maximal."
    },
